    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "John Day was officially founded in 1862 during the gold rush era when gold was discovered nearby.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.visitoregon.com/cities/john-day-oregon-2/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Gold mining, sheep and cattle ranching, and timber harvesting have historically been the economic mainstays of John Day.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Day%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The largest part of early John Day consisted of a Chinese community commonly known as Tiger Town.",
