      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Day%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Kam Wah Chung and Company store in John Day provides a glimpse into the lives of Chinese immigrants during the late 1800s.",
